WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.647
The next morning Toad slept late.

2
00:00:04.648 --> 00:00:08.792
As usual, he was the last at breakfast.

3
00:00:08.793 --> 00:00:11.271
The kitchen was empty.

4
00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:14.479
The table was messy.

5
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:18.765
"Egg shells?" said Toad, looking around.

6
00:00:18.766 --> 00:00:22.561
"Cold toast? No coffee?

7
00:00:22.562 --> 00:00:26.493
Didn't they save anything good for me?"

8
00:00:26.494 --> 00:00:30.590
He heard laughter through the window.

9
00:00:30.591 --> 00:00:33.459
Toad went outside.

10
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:38.415
Mole, Rat, and Badger were sitting in the garden.

11
00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:43.754
"Did you see the Chief Weasel?" laughed Rat.

12
00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:47.617
"He crashed through Toad's window!"

13
00:00:47.618 --> 00:00:52.439
"His face looked like this!" laughed Mole.

14
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.300
Mole made a funny face.

15
00:00:56.301 --> 00:01:00.382
"And when Badger waved his club—," said Rat.

16
00:01:00.383 --> 00:01:05.990
"The weasels crawled under the table!" cried Mole.

17
00:01:05.991 --> 00:01:10.892
Mole and Rat kicked their short legs in the air.

18
00:01:10.893 --> 00:01:14.449
They laughed until their stomachs hurt.

19
00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:18.845
Badger sat in a chair reading the newspaper.

20
00:01:18.846 --> 00:01:22.190
"Good morning, Toad!" said Badger.

21
00:01:22.191 --> 00:01:25.271
"You're up early, I see!"

22
00:01:25.272 --> 00:01:28.079
Toad turned red.

23
00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.902
He went inside to make his breakfast.

24
00:01:32.903 --> 00:01:35.984
Badger followed him in.

25
00:01:35.985 --> 00:01:41.272
"Well," said Badger, "you'll be busy this morning.

26
00:01:41.273 --> 00:01:44.605
You have a lot of work to do."

27
00:01:44.606 --> 00:01:49.184
"Oh Badger, stop joking," said Toad.

28
00:01:49.185 --> 00:01:53.576
"The whole riverbank expects it," said Badger.

29
00:01:53.577 --> 00:01:56.599
"Expects what?" said Toad.

30
00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:00.148
"You got your home back!" said Badger.

31
00:02:00.149 --> 00:02:04.601
"You must have a big party!"

